      "text": "Maria απομαγνητοφώνηση αποθήκευσε ως αρχείο κειμένου; δεν αποθήκευσε την αρχική ηχογράφηση."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Η απομαγνητοφώνηση έληξε σε 12 λεπτά. Η μετάφραση στα ελληνικά δεν έχει ξεκινήσει ακόμα."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "translations": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "Nikos sent the transcript to Ele, not to Elena."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Ele is the translator. Nikos does the recording and Elena checks the subtitles."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "translations": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "The receipt shows €12.50 for 2 items. The separate transfer is 5,000 sats, not 500 sats."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "The note mentions Bitcoin. It does not say that euros and sats are the same unit."
    }
    ]
  }

{
  "translations": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "I did not say that Anna sold all the books. I said that she did not sell any yesterday."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Today she can sell one, but this has not been decided."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "translations": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "Anna θα δημοσιοποιήσει το βίντεο μόνο αν το κείμενο επιτήρηση του Γιάννης."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "translations": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "Maria asked: 'Does the file have 12 chapters or 21?'"
    },
    {
      "id":  1,
      "text": "We still don't know the answer. The title alone isn't enough to confirm it."
    }
  ]
}

